    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T10:08:25Z",
    "body": "Only \"either\" is ambiguous if it means XOR or OR. In cases where XOR is the only option it's not ambiguous, so such cases are fine. But we could use \"If any of ...\" instead?\n",
