    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T12:14:44Z",
    "body": "This is way out of scope for IDL. This is just about how we use English words.\n\nI think \"either\" is fine. We already prohibit \"and/or\" in the lint script under the reasoning that \"or\" means inclusive or. I think \"either\" should mean inclusive either.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
