    "body": "> This is way out of scope for IDL. This is just about how we use English words.\n\nWell, these should still be defined somewhere, imho.\n\nI think a section in WebIDL that describes how to write and process algorithms doesn't seem completely out of place. We could always extract it into its own document later if it turns out it's weird to have it there.\n",
